  "description": "AXOXE is a new-generation open-source self-hosted platform designed for individual users. It is ultra-lightweight and low-cost, helping you easily publish and share ideas, writings, and links. With a clean, intuitive interface and powerful command-line tools, content management becomes simple and flexible. Your data is fully owned and controlled by you.",
